[[63,7,512,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Undo the bolt (1a) and remove the embellishment (1b).</p><p>2. Undo the fixing bolts (2a) and remove the external rearview mirror (2b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223003174.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,512,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Fit the external rearview mirror and fix it with the bolts.</p><p>Fit the embellishment and tighten the fixing bolt.</p>"]]